<title>USA: CFM Technologies offering priced at $30 shr.</title>
<headline>CFM Technologies offering priced at $30 shr.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFM Technologies Inc said its public offering of 1,670,000 common shares was priced at $30 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it sold 1.5 million of the shares and shareholders sold 170,000 of them.</p>
<p>The company said it also granted its underwriters an option to buy up to an additional 250,000 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Settlement of the offering is scheduled for Feb. 19.</p>
</text>
